Tests drive the real _github_fetch_job_log end-to-end via an upgraded
fake curl that emulates the no--o + -w '\n%{http_code}' shape the
Woodpecker calls use (previously unmodeled, so this path was untestable);
a happy-path test pins the base64 line-decode through the same harness.

